Error [E0993]: an arm head here is matched against the subject, not a free condition
  --> tests/ui/dispatch_predicate_arm.jet:7:9
    |
  7 |         code >= 500 -> { return "server error" }
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: every arm in `if subject == { … }` tests the subject; an arbitrary predicate has no subject to match
 Fix: use a range arm like `400..499 ->` for a band, or a boolean `if … { } else if … { }` for arbitrary predicates
